data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"The user wants me to generate a title for a conversation where the user asked: \"Create a file called hello.txt that contains exactly the word hello. Then say done.\"\n\nI need to follow the rules:\n- Same language as user message (English)\n- Grammatically correct, reads naturally\n- No tool names\n- Focus on main topic/question\n- Single line, ≤50 characters\n- Remove: the, this, my, a, an\n- Never assume tech stack\n- Never use tools\n- Don't respond to questions, just generate title\n- Don't include \"summarizing\" or \"generating\"\n- Always output something meaningful\n\nThe task is about creating hello.txt with the word \"hello\". I should focus on WHAT the user wants to do with the file.\n\nPossible titles:\n- Create hello.txt containing hello\n- hello.txt creation with hello content\n- Create hello.txt file with hello\n- hello.txt creation request\n- Create hello.txt and confirm completion\n\nLet me check character counts:\n- \"Create hello.txt containing hello\" = 31 chars\n- \"hello.txt creation with hello content\" = 36 chars\n- \"Create hello.txt and confirm completion"},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789836971,"id":"chatcmpl-1e7589c94c824e3090792c48a6099713","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

